@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765
@jobId = replace-with-job-id
@candidateId = replace-with-candidate-id
@renderId = replace-with-render-id

### Candidates with approval ({at, by, stale}), the latest export status and the last finished export.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/candidates

### Approve a candidate as its edit plan is now (422 E-QA-HARDFAIL when a hard QA check fails).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}/approval
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true}

### Withdraw the approval.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}/approval
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":false}

### Export one or more approved candidates: 202 with a render id each; 409 E-NOT-APPROVED (nothing started) lists the reasons.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/exports
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"candidate_ids":["{{candidateId}}"]}

### Validation error: nothing selected.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/exports
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"candidate_ids":[]}

### Progress of one export (queued / rendering / done / failed / cancelled).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/renders/{{renderId}}

### Withdraw a queued export (409 once it has started).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/renders/{{renderId}}/cancel
X-VideoCreator: 1

### List every pattern (job) of a project: preset names, options, state, candidate / approved / exported counts, busy flag.
@projectId = replace-with-project-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/patterns

### Delete one pattern: its candidates, edit plans, renders and files. 409 E-JOB-BUSY while it is generating or exporting.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
X-VideoCreator: 1